# The whole repo ships to Vercel by default, which put the test suite on the
# public site — /tests/fixtures/lockups.html answered 200 in production. None of
# this belongs on a page visitors can reach, and the fixture in particular is a
# half-rendered copy of the brand lockup that would be confusing to stumble on.
#
# Nothing here is needed to serve the site: index.html, css/, js/, assets/ and
# api/ are the deployment.
tests/
scripts/
playwright.config.mjs
playwright-report/
test-results/
.claude/
Learning.md
CLAUDE.md
docs/
